 "inter": [],
 "structural_change": "s81dv_idxtxi13 (S81-I13 2026-10-25): rank-aware indexed13 TX helper restructured accelerator-style: candidate rows in 2x 256x256 SRAM (one indexed13 word per row, 2 tag banks), per-qslot linked row lists, O(1) write-time duplicate/order check, streaming merge-join lookup with a 2-row window (no 1024-way compare), selected ids in 2x 128x256 SRAM, dense store 8x 1024x256 with RDL/WDL/RIL landings as n32x. 554 cycles command->done (K=512).",
 "why_floorplan": "Same TX slot 626.4 x 561.6 and the n32x two-column structure: dense banks 0-3 col A x 72.576, 4-7 col B x 378.432 (rows pitch 95.04, 24.6-um channels); candidate-row halves at y 423.36 in both columns (rq window sits in the mid band between them); id FIFO pair N-E at y 486 next to the vo pins (N face E half). Mid band 131 um holds the merge/pack logic.",
